  "body": "A highly specked 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom apartment with jaw dropping views from the third level.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen and laundry are fitted with Miele appliances, the home includes full automation, and ducted heating and cooling.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a prominent corner site at one of the highest points in the Bays, the elevation maximises sea views from both sides of the building.\r\n\r\nThe outlook is uninterrupted, capturing iconic landmarks from the northern aspect towards Gulf Harbour, and across to the city skyline over the Orakei Basin.\r\n\r\nOrakei remains one of Auckland’s most established and sought after coastal residential suburbs — offering convenience, amenity, and close proximity to Mission Bay, Orakei beaches, and an easy direct route into the CBD.\r\n\r\nThe apartment includes two secure internal car parks and a large walk-in storage unit.\r\n\r\nPriced to sell.",
